  "person_3": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
  "person_4": "FAMILY_MEMBER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I need you to take this seriously. I've been up all night reading about it, a lump in the neck, then headaches, then a tight chest, and every time I search the result is cancer."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I do take it seriously. Let me repeat that back. Worry about cancer, headaches, and chest tightness. When did the worry start, Daniel?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two months... no, three months. After my colleague's diagnosis."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And what's the headache like?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Band-like, across the forehead, mostly after I've been on the laptop."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the tight chest?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's, um, it comes when I'm thinking about it. I check my pulse about twenty times a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "He checks it at dinner. It drives me mad, sorry, Daniel. I'm his husband, Marcus. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's all right, Marcus. Daniel, any weight loss?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. I weigh myself every morning, it's the same."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any lump you can actually feel?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Well. No lump. I thought there was one. There isn't."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Tell me your medication."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sertraline, 50 mg, once a day. Propranolol, 10 mg, twice a day when I'm bad. And omeprazole, 20 mg, once a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "It's 100, love. The sertraline. I see the box."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's 50. Is it? I don't know any more."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "We'll check the pharmacy record for the sertraline. Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No allergies."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "History?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Anxiety, since uni. And irritable bowel."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tonsils, when I was nine. And a mole removed, 2018. It was nothing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Cancer in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother had breast cancer. That's partly why."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What's your work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "IT contractor, so I'm online all day anyway."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A few glasses of wine at the weekend."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exercise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I run. When I'm not checking things."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let's check you. Pulse 84, blood pressure 122 over 78, temperature 36.6, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 16, weight 77 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The pulse is fast. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's normal for a worried afternoon. Let me feel your neck.",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "There's nothing, is there? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I can't feel any lumps in your neck or armpits."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, shall I get the ECG machine ready? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please, Priya. Daniel, your heart sounds are normal, and the chest is clear."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your tummy is soft with no tender spots."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any problems with your breathing at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing at the moment."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your vision, balance, weakness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So what I'm hearing is an anxious mind that's very good at searching. This looks like health anxiety, but I can't rule out a thyroid problem driving the heart racing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So it's not cancer? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Nothing I've found suggests it. To be sure, I'd like to arrange a thyroid blood test, a blood count, and an ECG today."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll do the ECG in room two. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And limit the searching to one short check a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "I'll hold him to that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four weeks. Okay. Thank you. ~"
  }
